    "开启后，你通讯录里的号码不会进入垃圾信息；你手动加入的拦截号码仍然优先生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, numbers in your contacts won't be flagged as spam; numbers you blocked manually still take precedence."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，你通讯录里的号码不会进入垃圾信息；你手动加入的拦截号码仍然优先生效。"
