    "iPhone 通知自动化（iOS 27）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone notification automation (iOS 27)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 通知自动化（iOS 27）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 通知自動化（iOS 27）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在“快捷指令 → 自动化”中新建“收到通知”自动化：筛选 Bark 通知（可按 App、标题、正文过滤，例如标题包含 CallRelay 或正文包含来电），然后运行“检查来电”。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Shortcuts → Automation, create a “When I receive a notification” automation: filter Bark notifications (by app, title or body, e.g. title contains CallRelay or body contains incoming call), then run “Check incoming call”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“快捷指令 → 自动化”中新建“收到通知”自动化：筛选 Bark 通知（可按 App、标题、正文过滤，例如标题包含 CallRelay 或正文包含来电），然后运行“检查来电”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「捷徑 → 自動化」中新增「收到通知」自動化：篩選 Bark 通知（可依 App、標題、內文過濾，例如標題包含 CallRelay 或內文包含來電），然後執行「檢查來電」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 官方通知自动化说明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple's notification automation guide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 官方通知自动化说明"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 官方通知自動化說明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "旧版 iOS 与锁屏状态下的自动执行尚未验证；未设置自动化时，点按 Bark 通知会打开 App 并用本机配对检查是否有正在响铃的来电（手动回退路径）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic execution on older iOS versions and while locked has not been verified. Without an automation, tapping the Bark notification opens the app and checks for ringing calls using this phone's pairing (manual fallback)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "旧版 iOS 与锁屏状态下的自动执行尚未验证；未设置自动化时，点按 Bark 通知会打开 App 并用本机配对检查是否有正在响铃的来电（手动回退路径）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "舊版 iOS 與鎖屏狀態下的自動執行尚未驗證；未設定自動化時，點按 Bark 通知會開啟 App 並用本機配對檢查是否有正在響鈴的來電（手動回退路徑）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安全说明": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Security notes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全说明"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全說明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设备密钥只保存在网关，不写入通知或本地存储。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device key is stored only on the gateway; it is never written to a notification or local storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备密钥只保存在网关，不写入通知或本地存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置金鑰只儲存在閘道，不寫入通知或本機儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通知中的链接不含任何令牌；打开后仅用本机配对重新查询。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The notification link contains no token; opening it only re-queries using this phone's pairing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知中的链接不含任何令牌；打开后仅用本机配对重新查询。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知中的連結不含任何權杖；開啟後僅用本機配對重新查詢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网关只通知正在响铃的来电，并做去重与过期保护。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The gateway only notifies ringing incoming calls, with deduplication and stale protection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关只通知正在响铃的来电，并做去重与过期保护。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
